# People the maintainer trusts to contribute to Chargectl, and people blocked
# from it. Collaborators and bots are trusted without an entry. Someone is
# vouched after a merged pull request or an accepted bug report with a fix.
#
# Syntax (github.com/mitchellh/vouch):
#   github:username
#   -github:username reason for the denouncement
#
# Keep entries sorted. Only the maintainer changes this file.
